@startuml 7-2-redis-session-state
' 7-2. Redis - the state of one session (key session:{session_id}:state) and who moves it
' Traced from code at dev-rewrite e09d47b (2026-10-11)
' Each arrow: who calls -> services/session.py function -> clients/redis.py function (Redis command)
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false

title 7-2. Redis - session state

state "IDLE" as IDLE : no session:{id}:state key
state "BUFFERING" as BUFFERING : state = BUFFERING\none chat job is queued or waiting for silence
state "PROCESSING" as PROCESSING : state = PROCESSING\nthe worker is answering
state "CLOSING" as CLOSING : state = CLOSING\nthe sweeper is closing the session

[*] --> IDLE : session.open_for opens a session in PSQL\nRedis has no key for it yet

IDLE --> BUFFERING : controllers/line.on_message\nsession.start_buffering -> set_buffering_if_idle (SET NX)\nthen job.enqueue_chat
BUFFERING --> PROCESSING : worker.run_chat, after wait_for_silence\nsession.start_processing -> set_processing (SET)
PROCESSING --> IDLE : worker.run_chat, after line.reply\nsession.finish -> clear_state (DEL)

IDLE --> CLOSING : sweeper.sweep, session silent > CLOSE_AFTER_MINUTES\nsession.start_closing -> set_closing_if_idle (SET NX)
CLOSING --> IDLE : sweeper.finish_closing, session.close returned False\nsession.stop_closing -> clear_state (DEL)
CLOSING --> [*] : sweeper.finish_closing, session.close returned True\nclear_session (DEL buffer, last_message_at, state, history)\nthen job.enqueue_analyse

note right of IDLE
  a message arrives -> 4-1
  SET NX succeeds only from IDLE, so only one caller
  wins the move to BUFFERING or to CLOSING
end note

note right of BUFFERING
  a message arrives -> 4-3
  the sweeper skips this session
end note

note right of PROCESSING
  a message arrives -> 4-4
  the sweeper skips this session
  run_chat ends with an error before session.finish
  -> the key stays PROCESSING (4-2)
end note

note left of CLOSING
  a message arrives -> 4-5
  after CLOSING -> IDLE, if the buffer is not empty:
  sweeper.finish_closing calls session.start_buffering
  and job.enqueue_chat (IDLE -> BUFFERING)
end note
@enduml
